# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=shared-mime-info
pkgver=2.4
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="What kind of file is this: the shared file type database"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xdg/shared-mime-info"
license=(GPL-2.0-or-later)
depends=(glibc glib libxml2)
install=shared-mime-info.install
source=("https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xdg/shared-mime-info/-/archive/$pkgver/shared-mime-info-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('531291d0387eb94e16e775d7e73788d06d2b2fdd8cd2ac6b6b15287593b6a2de')

build() {
    meson setup shared-mime-info-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D update-mimedb=false -D build-tests=false -D build-translations=false
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
